1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,677
Sixteen restaurants, seven pools, and a private hot tub in every one of the one thousand three hundred thirty-four rooms.

2
00:00:08,727 --> 00:00:14,220
This is Moon Palace Cancun, on a white sand beach just minutes from the airport.

3
00:00:14,270 --> 00:00:18,527
It is a huge resort, so here is how to enjoy it.

4
00:00:18,576 --> 00:00:19,622
Start with the room.

5
00:00:19,672 --> 00:00:28,363
Every room has its own indoor hot tub, a memory foam bed, a fifty-five inch smart TV, and twenty-four hour room service.

6
00:00:28,413 --> 00:00:35,061
Play golf? One junior suite with a golf course view even comes with a golf cart included.

7
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:36,210
Now, the water.

8
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:41,172
There are seven outdoor pools, a water slide, and three swim-up bars.

9
00:00:41,222 --> 00:00:44,386
The beach club is free, and the beach is white sand.

10
00:00:44,437 --> 00:00:48,118
Find a spot by the pool, and let the day go slow.

11
00:00:48,168 --> 00:00:49,218
Then, eat.

12
00:00:49,268 --> 00:00:54,788
Sixteen restaurants, including Agra, Riviera Maya, and Pier 6 Seafood and Grill.

13
00:00:54,838 --> 00:00:58,813
Expect tacos, sushi, pasta, and a dessert counter.

14
00:00:58,863 --> 00:01:02,348
Breakfast is included, and room service runs all night.

15
00:01:02,398 --> 00:01:03,540
Need to slow down?

16
00:01:03,590 --> 00:01:09,314
Book the spa for a hot stone massage, reflexology, or the hydrotherapy circuit.

17
00:01:09,365 --> 00:01:12,491
Then walk back to a room with its own hot tub.

18
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:16,444
When the sun goes down, there is a nightclub and lively bars.

19
00:01:16,494 --> 00:01:19,686
By day, the Moon Palace Golf Club is a short walk away.

20
00:01:19,736 --> 00:01:22,790
And there are five pickleball courts.

21
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:24,649
A few things are good to know.

22
00:01:24,700 --> 00:01:30,966
The resort has two sections, Nizuc and Sunrise, and your room is assigned before you arrive.

23
00:01:31,015 --> 00:01:35,146
It is spread out, so expect to use the golf cart shuttles.

24
00:01:35,196 --> 00:01:40,630
One recent guest mentioned sales offers at check in, so be ready to politely say no.

25
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:46,831
Golf, massages, and spa treatments need a reservation, so book them before you arrive.

26
00:01:46,881 --> 00:01:48,386
So, is it worth it?

27
00:01:48,436 --> 00:01:54,813
Guests rate it eight point four out of ten on Expedia, and more than half of the reviews are perfect tens.

28
00:01:54,864 --> 00:01:57,451
My honest score is eight and a half out of ten.

29
00:01:57,501 --> 00:02:00,404
The link is in the description.
